## Output Format
Return a JSON array of edge cases. Each edge case must have:
- "title": descriptive name
- "description": what edge condition is being tested
- "input_condition": the boundary input or precondition
- "expected_behavior": how the system should handle this edge
- "severity": one of "critical", "high", "medium", "low"
- "category": one of "boundary", "empty/null", "format", "concurrency", "state", "data_type"
